<title>ESTONIA: LEKS GETS 9.6 MLN KROONS IN PREMIUMS IN MAY.</title>
<headline>LEKS GETS 9.6 MLN KROONS IN PREMIUMS IN MAY.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leks Insurance collected 9.6 million kroons in premiums in May and made payments of 1.4 million kroons, it said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Current year collections amounted to 40.2 million kroons and payments to 8.9 million kroons, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>Leks Insurance finance director Aarne Orav said the results were according to previous estimates.</p>
<p>Leks has applied to list its shares on the secondary list of the Tallinn bourse.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
